#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-details"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-details` — A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-details` — Een gestileerde native `<details>` disclosure met een roterende chevron."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the native `<details>` element, so the browser drives open and close plus keyboard support; the CSS only hides the default marker and supplies the rotating chevron."
msgstr "Gebouwd op het native `<details>`-element, zodat de browser het openen/sluiten en toetsenbordondersteuning regelt; de CSS verbergt alleen de standaardmarker en levert de roterende chevron."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the chevron after the summary."
msgstr "Plaats de chevron na de samenvatting."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Filled (surface) variant."
msgstr "Gevulde (surface) variant."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the disclosure is open."
msgstr "Tekent de disclosure-chevron van de samenvatting, een gemaskerde glyf die roteert om naar beneden te wijzen wanneer de disclosure open is."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — The bordered, grouped form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — De met rand omgeven, gegroepeerde vorm van dezelfde disclosure."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-group` — A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-group` — Een omlijnde disclosure gebouwd op `<details>`: een samenvattingsrij met chevron en inklapbare inhoud."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the same native `<details>` foundation as toggle-details; put the `<summary>` first so it becomes the clickable header row and the rest is the collapsible content."
msgstr "Gebouwd op dezelfde native `<details>`-basis als toggle-details; plaats de `<summary>` eerst zodat deze de klikbare koprij wordt en de rest de inklapbare inhoud is."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary row's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the group is open."
msgstr "Tekent de disclosure-chevron van de samenvattingsrij, een gemaskerd glyf dat draait om naar beneden te wijzen wanneer de groep open is."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — The single, unbordered form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — De enkele, zonder rand, vorm van dezelfde disclosure."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tooltip"
msgstr ""

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tooltip` — A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "`.instui-tooltip` — Een CSS hover- en focus-tooltipbubbel, positioneerbaar aan elke zijde."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Toggling is pure CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), so the bubble only reaches keyboard users through a focusable trigger; unlike `popover`, it isn't dismissible or click-triggered."
msgstr "Het schakelen is puur CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), dus de bubbel is alleen bereikbaar voor toetsenbordgebruikers via een focuserbare trigger; in tegenstelling tot `popover` is het niet wegklikbaar of door klikken geactiveerd."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Point the trigger at the bubble with aria-describedby and give the bubble role=\"tooltip\"."
msgstr "Wijs de trigger naar de bubbel met aria-describedby en geef de bubbel role=\"tooltip\"."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a trigger glyph icon next to the tooltip bubble."
msgstr "Plaats een trigger-glyph-icoon naast de tooltipbubbel."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The bubble; `-placement-*` sets its side."
msgstr "De bubbel; `-placement-*` bepaalt de zijde."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The larger, click-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Het grotere, door klikken geactiveerde verankerde oppervlak.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Een verwant verankerd oppervlak met een pijl."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: transition"
msgstr ""

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — animatiestatus-klassen voor de `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` en statusklassen (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, enz.) — te gebruiken los of gekoppeld aan elk component."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Transition type/state class toggled by runtime (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."
msgstr "Type overgang/statusklasse die door de runtime wordt omgeschakeld (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation duration (default `300ms`); override to speed up or slow down every transition state."
msgstr "Animatieduur (standaard `300ms`); overschrijven om elke overgangstoestand sneller of langzamer te maken."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation timing function (default `ease-in-out`)."
msgstr "Animatie-timingfunctie (standaard `ease-in-out`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tray` — An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "`.instui-tray` — Een aan de rand vastgezet paneel dat vanaf elke zijde naar binnen schuift; een native `[popover]` of `<dialog>`."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start/end placements resolve against `inset-inline` (logical, direction-aware); the slide-in transform mirrors automatically under an ancestor `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, so no extra markup is needed for right-to-left layouts."
msgstr "Start-/eindplaatsingen lossen op ten opzichte van `inset-inline` (logisch, richtingbewust); de slide-in-transformatie wordt automatisch gespiegeld onder een voorouder `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, dus geen extra markup nodig voor rechts-naar-links lay-outs."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The tray is a dialog or popover surface, so name it with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`, and its close control carries an `aria-label` (the `.instui-close-button` in the example uses `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."
msgstr "De tray is een dialoog- of popover-oppervlak, dus benoem het met `aria-label` of `aria-labelledby`, en de sluitknop heeft een `aria-label` (de `.instui-close-button` in het voorbeeld gebruikt `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the bottom edge."
msgstr "Bevestig aan de onderrand."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the end (inline-end) edge."
msgstr "Bevestig aan de eindrand (inline-end)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Pin to the start (inline-start) edge."
msgstr "(standaard) Bevestig aan de startrand (inline-start)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the top edge."
msgstr "Bevestig aan de bovenrand."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-size-md`."
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Opens with the native `[popover]` API and `@starting-style`; the slide-in sits behind an `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` guard, so browsers without it still open the tray, just without the slide."
msgstr "- Opent met de native `[popover]` API en `@starting-style`; de slide-in staat achter een `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)`-beveiliging, dus browsers zonder deze functie openen de tray nog steeds, alleen zonder de slide."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — The same dismissible overlay pattern, centred instead of edge-pinned.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer surface this builds on."
msgstr "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — Hetzelfde wegklikbare overlay-patroon, gecentreerd in plaats van aan de rand vastgezet.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Het generieke toplaag-oppervlak waarop dit is gebouwd."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tree-browser"
msgstr ""

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tree-browser` — A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "`.instui-tree-browser` — Een uitklapbare boom van geneste collecties en bladitems, met roterende chevrons."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each collection is a native `<details>`; nesting them inside one another builds the tree, and the browser handles opening and closing every branch."
msgstr "Elke collectie is een native `<details>`; door ze in elkaar te nestelen bouw je de boom, en de browser regelt het openen en sluiten van elke tak."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the root with role=\"tree\" and each nested list with role=\"group\"."
msgstr "Markeer de wortel met role=\"tree\" en elke geneste lijst met role=\"group\"."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render folder/file glyph icons in summaries and leaf items."
msgstr "Toon map-/bestandspictogrammen in samenvattingen en bladitems."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A leaf entry in the tree."
msgstr "Een bladvermelding in de boom."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws each collection's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the branch is open."
msgstr "Tekent de disclosure-chevron van elke collectie, een gemaskeerd pictogram dat roteert zodat het naar beneden wijst wanneer de tak open is."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries."
msgstr "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Beide tonen geneste, selecteerbare items."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: truncate"
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--truncate` — Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "`.--truncate` — Ellipsis-afkapping met lijnbegrenzing geregeld door `--lines` — bruikbaar los of gekoppeld aan een component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base class uses `display: -webkit-box` and reads the `--lines` custom property to clamp text to a fixed number of lines before it ends in an ellipsis."
msgstr "De basislaag gebruikt `display: -webkit-box` en leest de custom property `--lines` om tekst tot een vast aantal regels te beperken voordat deze in een ellipsis eindigt."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "JS Requirement"
msgstr "JS-vereiste"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component ships no CSS of its own — its markup and behavior come entirely from `@pantoken/interactions`. Its `--max-lines-auto` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "Deze component bevat geen eigen CSS — de markup en het gedrag komen volledig van `@pantoken/interactions`. De modifier `--max-lines-auto` wordt door dat gedrag aangestuurd. Zie de [modifiertabel hieronder](#modifiers)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-1`."
msgstr "Alias van `--max-lines-1`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-2`."
msgstr "Alias van `--max-lines-2`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-3`."
msgstr "Alias van `--max-lines-3`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-4`."
msgstr "Alias van `--max-lines-4`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-5`."
msgstr "Alias van `--max-lines-5`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to one line (default)."
msgstr "Beperk tot één regel (standaard)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to two lines."
msgstr "Beperk tot twee regels."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to three lines."
msgstr "Beperk tot drie regels."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to four lines."
msgstr "Beperk tot vier regels."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to five lines."
msgstr "Beperk tot vijf regels."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — — Clamp to the number of lines that fit in the container, based on its height and the line height of the text."
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Enables truncation and line clamping on the target element."
msgstr "Zorgt voor afkapping en lijnbegrenzing op het doel-element."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Truncate at the character level."
msgstr "(standaard) Afkappen op karakterniveau."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Truncate at the word level."
msgstr "Afkappen op woordniveau."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Clamping relies on `-webkit-line-clamp` with `display: -webkit-box`, paired with the standard `line-clamp`."
msgstr "- Begrenzing is afhankelijk van `-webkit-line-clamp` met `display: -webkit-box`, gecombineerd met de standaard `line-clamp`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography that this truncates."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body-typografie die hierdoor wordt afgekapt."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: two-column"
msgstr ""

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Lay-out met twee kolommen met linker- en rechterinhoudsgebieden."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "✅ Gebruik Two-Column wanneer:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You have two content areas of roughly equal importance\n- Comparing or contrasting two sets of content side-by-side\n- Building a responsive layout that stacks on mobile\n🚫 Don't use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "- Je twee inhoudsgebieden hebt die ongeveer even belangrijk zijn\n- Je twee sets inhoud naast elkaar wilt vergelijken of contrasteren\n- Je een responsieve lay-out bouwt die op mobiele apparaten stapelt\n🚫 Gebruik Two-Column niet wanneer:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- One column dominates the page — use asymmetric layout instead\n- Content doesn't benefit from side-by-side presentation"
msgstr "- Één kolom de pagina domineert — gebruik in plaats daarvan een asymmetrische lay-out\n- Inhoud geen baat heeft bij een presentatie naast elkaar"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure both columns are perceivable and usable on narrow viewports\n- Use semantic landmarks (e.g., `<section>`) to wrap column content\n- Maintain sufficient space and contrast between columns"
msgstr "- Zorg dat beide kolommen zichtbaar en bruikbaar zijn op smalle weergavevensters\n- Gebruik semantische landmarks (bijv. `<section>`) om kolominhoud te omsluiten\n- Zorg voor voldoende ruimte en contrast tussen de kolommen"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional visual divider between columns."
msgstr "Optionele visuele scheiding tussen kolommen."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Left column content area."
msgstr "Inhoudsgebied van de linker kolom."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Right column content area."
msgstr "Inhoudsgebied van de rechter kolom."

#: css/view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: view"
msgstr ""

#: css/view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-view` — The View primitive: a neutral box with key-value modifiers for background, border, radius, shadow, display, position, overflow, and cursor. Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` utilities."
msgstr "`.instui-view` — De View-primitive: een neutrale box met key-value modifiers voor achtergrond, rand, radius, schaduw, display, positie, overflow en cursor. Elk van deze modifiers is ook globaal beschikbaar (zonder context, of gekoppeld aan elk ander component) — zie de `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` utilities."

#: css/view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [view.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/view/view.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [view.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/view/view.css)"

