msgid "### source"
msgstr "### source"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### bubbles"
msgstr "### bubbles"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`bubbles`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event bubbles up through the DOM tree or not."
msgstr "De **`bubbles`** lees-alleen eigenschap van de Event-interface geeft aan of het event door de DOM-boom omhoog bubbelt of niet."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~cancelBubble~~"
msgstr "### ~~cancelBubble~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelBubble`** property of the Event interface is deprecated. Use Event.stopPropagation() instead. Setting its value to true before returning from an event handler prevents propagation of the event. In later implementations, setting this to false does nothing. See Browser compatibility for details."
msgstr "De **`cancelBubble`** eigenschap van de Event-interface is verouderd. Gebruik in plaats daarvan Event.stopPropagation(). Het instellen ervan op true voordat een event-handler terugkeert voorkomt propagatie van het event. In latere implementaties doet het instellen op false niets. Zie Browser-compatibiliteit voor details."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Deprecated"
msgstr "#### Verouderd"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cancelable"
msgstr "### cancelable"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelable`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event can be canceled, and therefore prevented as if the event never happened."
msgstr "De **`cancelable`** lees-alleen eigenschap van de Event-interface geeft aan of het event annuleerbaar is en dus kan worden verhinderd alsof het nooit heeft plaatsgevonden."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composed"
msgstr "### composed"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`composed`** property of the Event interface returns a boolean value which indicates whether or not the event will propagate across the shadow DOM boundary into the standard DOM."
msgstr "De lees-alleen **`composed`** eigenschap van de Event-interface retourneert een boolean die aangeeft of het event al dan niet over de shadow DOM-grens zal propagëren naar de standaard DOM."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### currentTarget"
msgstr "### currentTarget"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`currentTarget`** read-only property of the Event interface identifies the element to which the event handler has been attached."
msgstr "De **`currentTarget`** lees-alleen eigenschap van de Event-interface identificeert het element waaraan de event-handler is gekoppeld."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### defaultPrevented"
msgstr "### defaultPrevented"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`defaultPrevented`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a boolean value indicating whether or not the call to Event.preventDefault() canceled the event."
msgstr "De **`defaultPrevented`** lees-alleen eigenschap van de Event-interface retourneert een boolean die aangeeft of de oproep naar Event.preventDefault() het event heeft geannuleerd."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### eventPhase"
msgstr "### eventPhase"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`eventPhase`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates which phase of the event flow is currently being evaluated."
msgstr "De **`eventPhase`** lees-alleen eigenschap van de Event-interface geeft aan welke fase van de event-flow momenteel wordt geëvalueerd."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### isTrusted"
msgstr "### isTrusted"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`isTrusted`** read-only property of the Event interface is a boolean value that is true when the event was generated by the user agent (including via user actions and programmatic methods such as HTMLElement.focus()), and false when the event was dispatched via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). The only exception is the click event, which initializes the isTrusted property to false in user agents."
msgstr "De **`isTrusted`** lees-alleen eigenschap van de Event-interface is een boolean die true is wanneer het event door de user agent is gegenereerd (inclusief via gebruikersacties en programmatische methoden zoals HTMLElement.focus()), en false wanneer het event is verzonden via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). De enige uitzondering is het click-event, dat in user agents de isTrusted-eigenschap initieert als false."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~returnValue~~"
msgstr "### ~~returnValue~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Event property **`returnValue`** indicates whether the default action for this event has been prevented or not."
msgstr "De Event-eigenschap **`returnValue`** geeft aan of de standaardactie voor dit event is verhinderd of niet."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~srcElement~~"
msgstr "### ~~srcElement~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecated **`Event.srcElement`** is an alias for the Event.target property. Use Event.target instead."
msgstr "De verouderde **`Event.srcElement`** is een alias voor de Event.target-eigenschap. Gebruik Event.target in plaats daarvan."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`target`** property of the Event interface is a reference to the object onto which the event was dispatched. It is different from Event.currentTarget when the event handler is called during the bubbling or capturing phase of the event."
msgstr "De lees-alleen **`target`** eigenschap van de Event-interface is een referentie naar het object waarop het event is verzonden. Dit verschilt van Event.currentTarget wanneer de event-handler wordt aangeroepen tijdens de bubbling- of capturing-fase van het event."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### timeStamp"
msgstr "### timeStamp"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`timeStamp`** read-only property of the Event interface returns the time (in milliseconds) at which the event was created."
msgstr "De **`timeStamp`** lees-alleen eigenschap van de Event-interface geeft de tijd (in milliseconden) terug waarop het event is aangemaakt."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`type`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a string containing the event's type. It is set when the event is constructed and is the name commonly used to refer to the specific event, such as click, load, or error."
msgstr "De **`type`** lees-alleen eigenschap van de Event-interface retourneert een string met het type van het event. Het wordt ingesteld wanneer het event wordt geconstrueerd en is de naam die gewoonlijk wordt gebruikt om naar het specifieke event te verwijzen, zoals click, load of error."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### NONE"
msgstr "### NONE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### AT\\_TARGET"
msgstr "### AT\\_TARGET"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composedPath()"
msgstr "### composedPath()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`composedPath()`** method of the Event interface returns the event's path which is an array of the objects on which listeners will be invoked. This does not include nodes in shadow trees if the shadow root was created with its ShadowRoot.mode closed."
msgstr "De **`composedPath()`** methode van de Event-interface retourneert het pad van het event, dat een array is van de objecten waarop listeners zullen worden aangeroepen. Dit omvat geen knooppunten in shadow trees als de shadow root is gemaakt met ShadowRoot.mode op closed."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~initEvent()~~"
msgstr "### ~~initEvent()~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`Event.initEvent()`** method is used to initialize the value of an event created using Document.createEvent()."
msgstr "De **`Event.initEvent()`** methode wordt gebruikt om de waarde van een event te initialiseren dat is gemaakt met Document.createEvent()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### type"
msgstr "##### type"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### bubbles?"
msgstr "##### bubbles?"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### cancelable?"
msgstr "##### cancelable?"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### preventDefault()"
msgstr "### preventDefault()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`preventDefault()`** method of the Event interface tells the user agent that the event is being explicitly handled, so its default action, such as page scrolling, link navigation, or pasting text, should not be taken."
msgstr "De **`preventDefault()`** methode van de Event-interface vertelt de user agent dat het event expliciet wordt afgehandeld, zodat de standaardactie, zoals het scrollen van de pagina, navigatie naar een link of het plakken van tekst, niet moet plaatsvinden."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### stopImmediatePropagation()"
msgstr "### stopImmediatePropagation()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents other listeners of the same event from being called."
msgstr "De **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** methode van de Event-interface voorkomt dat andere listeners van hetzelfde event worden aangeroepen."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### stopPropagation()"
msgstr "### stopPropagation()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopPropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents further propagation of the current event in the capturing and bubbling phases. It does not, however, prevent any default behaviors from occurring; for instance, clicks on links are still processed. If you want to stop those behaviors, see the preventDefault() method. It also does not prevent propagation to other event-handlers of the current element. If you want to stop those, see stopImmediatePropagation()."
msgstr "De **`stopPropagation()`** methode van de Event-interface voorkomt verdere propagatie van het huidige event tijdens de capturing- en bubbling-fases. Het voorkomt echter niet dat standaardgedragingen plaatsvinden; bijvoorbeeld, klikken op links worden nog steeds verwerkt. Als die gedragingen gestopt moeten worden, zie de preventDefault()-methode. Het voorkomt ook niet de propagatie naar andere event-handlers op hetzelfde element. Als dat gewenst is, zie stopImmediatePropagation()."

