#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `!important` to component declarations so they beat Pendo's styles (default `true`)."
msgstr "Voeg `!important` toe aan componentdeclaraties zodat ze Pendo's stijlen overrulen (standaard `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "Tree-shake ongebruikte `--instui-*`-tokens (standaard `true`; uit levert de volledige tokenset)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "Converteer `@property` at-rules naar gewone custom-property declaraties via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (standaard `false`). `true` gebruikt plugin-standaarden met\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` zodat de declaraties in het `@scope`-blok terechtkomen.\nGeef een [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object mee om individuele standaardwaarden te overschrijven."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "Verklein `--instui-*`-namen naar minimale base-26-identificatoren via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(standaard `false`). Dit is veilig omdat de volledige token- + component-stylesheet een\nzelfstandig pakket is. Geef een [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object mee om de standaardwaarden te overschrijven."

