msgstr "`@pantoken/react-markdown` — rendert Markdown met Instructure UI-componenten en pantoken-pictogrammen."

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The default entry renders GitHub-Flavored Markdown, inline `:icon:` tokens (via\n`@pantoken/rehype` + `@pantoken/icons`), color-code swatches, and GitHub-style alerts. The MDX\nprovider lives at `@pantoken/react-markdown/mdx`."
msgstr "De standaardweergave rendert GitHub-Flavored Markdown, inline `:icon:` tokens (via\n`@pantoken/rehype` + `@pantoken/icons`), kleurgecodeerde kleurstalen en GitHub-stijl waarschuwingen. De MDX\nprovider bevindt zich op `@pantoken/react-markdown/mdx`."

