#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One documented CSS record: its base class plus everything derived from the CSS + doc comments."
msgstr "Eén gedocumenteerd CSS-record: de basis‑klasse plus alles dat is afgeleid van de CSS + doc‑commentaren."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The record name from `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name`, e.g. `button`."
msgstr "De recordnaam uit `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name`, bijv. `button`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### kind"
msgstr "### kind"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which kind of CSS surface this documents (defaults to `component`)."
msgstr "Welk type CSS‑oppervlak dit documenteert (standaard `component`)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base CSS selector — a class (`.button`), attribute (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), ID (`#foo`),\n or shadow-DOM pseudo (`:host`) — inferred from the first bare-class rule or set explicitly via\n `@selector`. Always non-empty (falls back to `.${name}` when inference fails)."
msgstr "De basis CSS‑selector — een klasse (`.button`), attribuut (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), ID (`#foo`),\n of shadow‑DOM pseudo (`:host`) — afgeleid van de eerste bare‑class regel of expliciet ingesteld via\n `@selector`. Altijd niet‑leeg (valt terug op `.${name}` als afleiding faalt)."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### summary?"
msgstr "### summary?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One-line summary from `@summary`."
msgstr "Eén‑regelige samenvatting uit `@summary`."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### remarks?"
msgstr "### remarks?"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
